@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Terminal Operator" as OPERATOR
participant ":System" as System
participant "WMS" as WMS

activate OPERATOR

OPERATOR -> System : requests to unload wagons (wagons.csv)
@startuml

actor Planner as P
participant "Warehouse Management System (WMS)" as S

P -> S: Select packing heuristic (FF / FFD / BFD)\nand input trolley capacity
S --> P: Confirm input received

P -> S: Request picking plan generation

S -> S: Retrieve allocation rows from USEI02
S -> S: Apply selected heuristic to pack allocations
S -> S: Check trolley capacity and split/defer items if needed
S -> S: Calculate trolley utilization (usedWeight / capacityWeight)
S -> P: Return picking plan summary\n(number of trolleys, utilization, plan details)

@enduml

